in, by měli být opatrní. Vždy se poraďte se svým lékařem o možných interakcích, abyste zajistili bezpečnost na základě svého zdravotního stavu a léčebného plánu.</div><div><div><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></div></article></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Button" data-key="button" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1722831447924" class="element-wrap gf_gs-spacing-xs-m-top" data-icon="gpicon-gpicon-button" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1722831447924" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:40,&quot;y&quot;:8207,&quot;w&quot;:400,&quot;h&quot;:69,&quot;abs_x&quot;:299,&quot;abs_y&quot;:8267}" style=""><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-stretch-lg="0" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:40,&quot;y&quot;:8207,&quot;w&quot;:400,&quot;h&quot;:69,&quot;abs_x&quot;:299,&quot;abs_y&quot;:8267}" data-stretch-xs="0"><a class="button btn gf_button gf_gs-spacing-xs-p-left gf_gs-spacing-xs-p-right gf_gs-spacing-sm-p-bottom gf_gs-spacing-sm-p-top gf_gs-button-element gf_gs-button---large" href="#m-1717055659322" target="" data-scroll-speed="2000" data-exc="" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:112,&quot;y&quot;:8207,&quot;w&quot;:254,&quot;h&quot;:69,&quot;abs_x&quot;:371,&quot;abs_y&quot;:8267}" data-scroll-speed-xs="2000"><span bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:120,&quot;y&quot;:8232,&quot;w&quot;:238,&quot;h&quot;:19,&quot;abs_x&quot;:379,&quot;abs_y&quot;:8292}">►  SHILAJIT BEZ RIZIKA VYZKOUŠET</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1722829183208" class="element-wrap gf_gs-spacing-xs-m-top" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1722829183208" bis_size="{&quot;x&quot;:8,&quot;y&quot;:8292,&quot;w&quot;:464,&quot;h&quot;:42,&quot;abs_x&quot;:267,&quot;abs_y&quot;:8352}"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf_gs-text-paragraph-2" data-gemlang="en"